* REG - Z-SYSTEM USER REGISTERS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* REG - Z-SYSTEM USER REGISTERS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    REG
    REG register-number
    REG Sregister-number value

Displays or changes Z-System user registers used by aliases and condition
tests. REG alone displays values. The S form sets a register; other
compiled forms print or modify values.

Example inspection: REG 0

Changing registers can affect later command sequences. These are Z-System
environment registers, not a debugger display of CPU registers.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
